    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4311" root="ثبت" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبِيتٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَابِتٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Firm in intellect,
understanding,</i> or <i>mind:</i> (S, K, TA:) and <i>firm
in strength and intellect:</i> (TA:) or <i>firm of heart</i>
in war: (Msb:) see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبْتٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And, applied
to a horse, <i>Sharp, and light,</i> or <i>active, in his
running;</i> (M, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبْتٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

